<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">To increase the scale of
NewGenIvf&rsquo;s operations, NewGenIvf expanded its Thailand fertility services by leasing a new property for its second clinic Erawan
Consultation Clinic in May&nbsp;2023. Consisting of approximately 2,600 sq. ft., Erawan Consultation Clinic has obtained its license
and has been open since June 2025.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Currently, IVF treatments
are performed in its Thailand and Cambodia clinics, egg donation services are provided in its Cambodia clinic, and surrogacy services
are provided in its Kyrgyzstan clinic. The following table summarises the services available at NewGenIvf&rsquo;s clinics:</P>

