    We will not receive any of the proceeds from such sales. However, we may receive up to $500,000,000 in gross proceeds under the White
    Lion Purchase Agreement from sales of Class A Ordinary Shares that we may elect to make to White Lion pursuant to the White Lion
    Purchase Agreement. In addition, we may receive proceeds from the conversion of the Additional Notes, the Exchange Notes, the Warrants
    and the New CB Initial Note. All proceeds from the conversion of the Additional Notes, Exchange Notes, Warrants, New CB Initial Note,
    and the sales of Class A Ordinary Shares to White Lion will be used for working capital and other general corporate purposes.</FONT></TD></TR>
