    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">selecting compensation
    consultant, legal counsel or other adviser only after taking into consideration all factors relevant to that person&rsquo;s independence
    from management;</FONT></TD></TR>
