<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">*</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Subsequent to 2024 yearend,
    the Company carried out a 1-for-20 reverse stock split, a 1-for-10 reverse stock split and a 1-for-5 reverse stock split of its issued
    and unissued shares which was effected on February 11, 2025, May 5, 2025, and August 4, 2025, respectively. The shares above have
    been adjusted retrospectively for these reverse stock splits.</FONT></TD></TR>
