<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">To increase the scale of
NewGenIvf&rsquo;s operations, NewGenIvf expanded its Thailand fertility services by leasing a new property for its second clinic Erawan
Consultation Clinic in May&nbsp;2023. Consisting of approximately 2,500 sq. ft., Erawan Consultation Clinic has been open since June
2025.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center"></P>

