<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">As of June&nbsp;30, 2025
and December 31, 2024, the Company had net operating loss carry forward of $386,988 and $160,432. The Company believes it is less likely
than not that its operations will be able to fully utilize its deferred tax assets related to the net operating loss carry forward. As
a result, the Company provided 100% allowance on deferred tax assets on net operating loss.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></P>

